            "sid": "REV 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Entaama Ento bwe yakakampula akamanhiso akokutaanu, naabona ghansi gh'alutaari emyoyo gy'abo abaitibwa olw'okwikiriza ekibono kya Katonda n'olw'okukidhulira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baayasiikana bati: “Wo Musengwa Aghanga Ebintu Byonabyona, omutukuvu era ow'amazima, olisalira li abantu ab'oku nsi omusango okubasinga, n'obeesasuulizaaku olw'okutwita?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho kiisi mulala yaagheebwa ekivaalo ekyeru, era baabakoba okuteegaku akaseera katono, okutuusa omughendo gw'abagheereza banaibwe, era baganda baibwe ab'okwitibwa nga beene, lwe gulighera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
